#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/graph_mode.md:31
msgid "How Graph Mode Works on Ascend"
msgstr "图模式在 Ascend 上的工作原理"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/graph_mode.md:33
msgid ""
"The default graph path on Ascend involves two stages: **compile-time "
"optimization** and **runtime capture/replay**. ACLGraph handles the runtime "
"capture/replay. The compile-time stage differs by `cudagraph_mode`:"
msgstr ""
"Ascend 上的默认图路径包含两个阶段：**编译时优化** 和 **运行时捕获/重放**。ACLGraph 处理运行时捕获/重放。编译时阶段因 "
"`cudagraph_mode` 而异："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/graph_mode.md:35
msgid ""
"**FULL_AND_PIECEWISE**: Default mode, same as the upstream vLLM strategy. "
"The compile-time path follows PIECEWISE compilation, while the runtime may "
"still use full-graph behavior for uniform decode batches."
msgstr ""
"**FULL_AND_PIECEWISE**：默认模式，与上游 vLLM 策略相同。编译时路径遵循 PIECEWISE "
"编译，而运行时对于均匀解码批次可能仍使用全图行为。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/graph_mode.md:36
msgid ""
"**FULL / FULL_DECODE_ONLY**: Npugraph_ex optimizes the FX graph via "
"npugraph_ex (`force_eager=True`, compile-time only, no capture). The "
"optimized callable is then captured and replayed by ACLGraph at runtime."
msgstr ""
"**FULL / FULL_DECODE_ONLY**：Npugraph_ex 通过 npugraph_ex 优化 FX "
"图（`force_eager=True`，仅编译时，无捕获）。优化后的可调用对象随后由 ACLGraph 在运行时捕获和重放。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/graph_mode.md:37
msgid ""
"**PIECEWISE**: Npugraph_ex is disabled. Only basic FX fusion passes are "
"applied at compile-time. ACLGraph captures and replays the resulting "
"callable at runtime."
msgstr ""
"**PIECEWISE**：Npugraph_ex 被禁用。编译时仅应用基本的 FX 融合 pass。ACLGraph "
"在运行时捕获和重放生成的可调用对象。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/graph_mode.md:38
msgid ""
"**NONE**: No compilation or graph capture. The model runs in eager mode."
msgstr "**NONE**：无编译或图捕获。模型以 eager 模式运行。"

