"Collect a profiling trace of your running model using [Ascend PyTorch "
"Profiler](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/Pytorch/2600/apiref/torchnpuCustomsapi/docs/zh/custom_APIs/torch_npu-"
"profiler/torch_npu-profiler-profile.md) (`torch_npu.profiler`)."
msgstr ""
