#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/graph_mode.md:228
msgid "Using XliteGraph"
msgstr "使用 XliteGraph"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/graph_mode.md:230
msgid ""
"XliteGraph is an optional graph path for the Llama and Qwen dense series, "
"the Qwen MoE series, Qwen3-VL, and DeepSeek-V3 / V3.2-class MoE models "
"(including GLM-4 / GLM-5 / GLM-5.1 and MiniMax-M2). It requires the `xlite` "
"package to be installed and is configured through the `xlite_graph_config` "
"additional-config key (see the `xlite_graph_config` table under "
"[Configuration options](../configuration/additional_config.md#configuration-"
"options))."
msgstr ""
"XliteGraph 是 Llama 和 Qwen 稠密系列、Qwen MoE 系列、Qwen3-VL 以及 DeepSeek-V3 / V3.2 类 "
"MoE 模型（包括 GLM-4 / GLM-5 / GLM-5.1 和 MiniMax-M2）的可选图路径。它需要安装 `xlite` 包，并通过 "
"`xlite_graph_config` additional-config "
"键进行配置（请参阅[配置选项](../configuration/additional_config.md#configuration-options)"
" 下的 `xlite_graph_config` 表）。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/graph_mode.md:232
msgid "Install Xlite first:"
msgstr "首先安装 Xlite："

msgid "### Decode-only vs. full mode"
msgstr "### Decode-only 模式与 full 模式"

msgid ""
"XliteGraph has two modes, selected by `xlite_graph_config.full_mode`. In "
"both modes, every batch is routed by its **token count** (the maximum number "
"of tokens across all data-parallel ranks): batches that fit within the token "
"budget xlite preallocates are executed by the xlite runtime — regardless of "
"whether they contain prefill or decode — while larger batches fall back to "
"the native runnable, captured/replayed by ACLGraph. The modes differ in the "
"token budget xlite preallocates:"
msgstr ""
"XliteGraph 有两种模式，通过 `xlite_graph_config.full_mode` 选择。在这两种模式下，每个批次都根据其"
"**token 数量**（所有数据并行 rank 中的最大 token 数）进行路由：在 xlite 预分配的 token 预算内的批次"
"由 xlite 运行时执行 —— 无论其包含预填充还是解码 —— 而更大的批次回退到原生 runnable，由 ACLGraph "
"捕获/重放。两种模式的区别在于 xlite 预分配的 token 预算："

msgid ""
"| Mode | `full_mode` | Preallocated token budget | Batches handled by the "
"xlite runtime |"
msgstr "| 模式 | `full_mode` | 预分配的 token 预算 | 由 xlite 运行时处理的批次 |"

msgid ""
"| **Decode-only** (default) | `False` | `max_num_seqs × (1 + num_speculative_tokens)` | Batches within the "
"decode-sized budget — typically decode steps (including MTP), and any small prefill/mixed batch that "
"happens to fit |"
msgstr ""
"| **Decode-only**（默认） | `False` | `max_num_seqs × (1 + num_speculative_tokens)` | "
"解码规模预算内的批次 —— 通常是解码步骤（包括 MTP），以及恰好符合预算的小型预填充/混合批次 |"

msgid ""
"| **Full** | `True` | `max-num-batched-tokens` | Any batch up to "
"`max-num-batched-tokens`, i.e., prefill, decode, and mixed batches alike |"
msgstr ""
"| **Full** | `True` | `max-num-batched-tokens` | 不超过 `max-num-batched-tokens` 的任何批次，"
"即预填充、解码和混合批次 |"

msgid ""
"In **decode-only mode** (the default), the budget is sized for a decode "
"step: the maximum number of running requests times the per-request decode "
"tokens (1, plus the speculative tokens when MTP-style speculative decoding "
"is enabled). Batches that exceed this budget — such as prefill and large "
"mixed batches — fall back to the native runnable. This keeps the xlite "
"hidden-state workspace small, and is the recommended option — `Xlite` is "
"still evolving, and decode-only mode is more performant and robust for most "
"workloads."
msgstr ""
"在 **decode-only 模式**（默认）下，预算按单个解码步骤的大小设定：最大运行请求数乘以每个请求的解码 "
"token 数（1，启用 MTP 类投机解码时加上投机 token 数）。超出该预算的批次 —— 例如预填充和大型混合批次"
" —— 回退到原生 runnable。这使 xlite 的隐状态工作区保持较小，也是推荐选项 —— `Xlite` 仍在演进中，"
"对于大多数工作负载，decode-only 模式性能更优且更稳健。"

msgid ""
"In **full mode**, the budget is `max-num-batched-tokens`, so the xlite "
"runtime drives prefill and decode alike; only batches that exceed "
"`max-num-batched-tokens` (e.g., certain profile runs) fall back. Because "
"xlite itself manages the full forward, ACLGraph capture should be disabled, "
"especially under memory constraints, for higher concurrency and better "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"在 **full 模式**下，预算为 `max-num-batched-tokens`，因此 xlite 运行时同样驱动预填充和解码；"
"仅超出 `max-num-batched-tokens` 的批次（例如某些 profile 运行）会回退。由于 xlite 自身管理完整的"
"前向过程，应禁用 ACLGraph 捕获，尤其是在内存受限的场景下，以获得更高的并发和更好的性能。"

msgid ""
"!!! note\n"
"\n"
"    Since v0.28.0, batches are routed by **token count** instead of the "
"batch attention state: any batch within the preallocated budget runs on the "
"xlite runtime, whether prefill, decode, or mixed. Before v0.28.0, "
"decode-only mode only handled batches whose attention state was decode — "
"any batch with a prefill was routed back to ACLGraph — so small "
"prefill/mixed batches could never take the xlite path."
msgstr ""
"!!! note\n"
"\n"
"    自 v0.28.0 起，批次根据 **token 数量**而非批次注意力状态进行路由：任何在预分配预算内的批次都由 "
"xlite 运行时执行，无论是预填充、解码还是混合批次。在 v0.28.0 之前，decode-only 模式仅处理注意力状态"
"为解码的批次 —— 任何包含预填充的批次都会被路由回 ACLGraph —— 因此小型预填充/混合批次永远无法走 "
"xlite 路径。"

msgid "### Supported models"
msgstr "### 支持的模型"

msgid ""
"The xlite adapter registers architectures by their `config.json` "
"`architectures` field. The currently supported set:"
msgstr "xlite 适配器根据模型的 `config.json` 中 `architectures` 字段注册架构。当前支持的集合："

msgid "| Architecture | Attention | Adapter |"
msgstr "| 架构 | 注意力 | 适配器 |"
msgid ""
"| `LlamaForCausalLM`, `Qwen2ForCausalLM`, `Qwen3ForCausalLM` | MHA | "
"`StandardXliteModel` |"
msgstr ""
"| `LlamaForCausalLM`, `Qwen2ForCausalLM`, `Qwen3ForCausalLM` | MHA | "
"`StandardXliteModel` |"

msgid ""
"| `Qwen3VLForConditionalGeneration` | MHA (multimodal) | "
"`StandardXliteModel` |"
msgstr ""
"| `Qwen3VLForConditionalGeneration` | MHA（多模态） | "
"`StandardXliteModel` |"

msgid ""
"| `Qwen3MoeForCausalLM`, `Qwen3VLMoeForConditionalGeneration` | MHA + MoE | "
"`QwenMoeXliteModel` |"
msgstr ""
"| `Qwen3MoeForCausalLM`, `Qwen3VLMoeForConditionalGeneration` | MHA + MoE | "
"`QwenMoeXliteModel` |"

msgid "| `Glm4MoeForCausalLM` | MHA + MoE | `Glm4MoeXliteModel` |"
msgstr "| `Glm4MoeForCausalLM` | MHA + MoE | `Glm4MoeXliteModel` |"

msgid "| `DeepseekV3ForCausalLM` | MLA + MoE | `DeepseekV3XliteModel` |"
msgstr "| `DeepseekV3ForCausalLM` | MLA + MoE | `DeepseekV3XliteModel` |"

msgid ""
"| `DeepseekV32ForCausalLM`, `GlmMoeDsaForCausalLM` | DSA + MoE | "
"`DeepseekV32XliteModel` |"
msgstr ""
"| `DeepseekV32ForCausalLM`, `GlmMoeDsaForCausalLM` | DSA + MoE | "
"`DeepseekV32XliteModel` |"

msgid "| `MiniMaxM2ForCausalLM` | MHA + MoE | `MiniMaxM2XliteModel` |"
msgstr "| `MiniMaxM2ForCausalLM` | MHA + MoE | `MiniMaxM2XliteModel` |"

msgid "### Example"
msgstr "### 示例"

msgid ""
"Serving `Qwen3-30B-A3B` (`Qwen3MoeForCausalLM`, MHA + MoE) on 4 NPU cards with "
"tensor parallelism of 4, and expert parallelism enabled. Full mode is shown; drop "
"`\"full_mode\": true` for decode-only."
msgstr ""
"在 4 卡上提供 `Qwen3-30B-A3B`（`Qwen3MoeForCausalLM`，MHA + MoE）服务，每节点张量并行"
"为 4，并启用专家并行。此处展示 full 模式；如需 decode-only 模式，请去掉 `\"full_mode\": true`。"

